Description: lightweight dictionary for the open .aldict format
 AlphaDict is a lightweight dictionary application that reads dictionaries
 in the open .aldict format.  It offers full-text lookup, a headword index,
 a vocabulary book and on-screen word capture under X11.
 .
 The package also ships aldctl, a command line tool that turns plain-text or
 XML files in the AlphaDict front-end format into .aldict dictionaries (and
 back), together with
 Python helper scripts for importing Cedict, StarDict, dicts.info and IDP
 dictionaries, a small English-Chinese sample dictionary and the dictionary
 format documentation.
